          <p>If the binary isn't installed, the extension offers an <strong>Install cartog</strong> action (macOS/Linux): it opens a terminal with the version-pinned installer typed in but not run, so you review the <code>curl … | sh</code> line before pressing Enter. After it finishes, run <strong>cartog: Recheck</strong> from the Command Palette to register the server — it then offers to index the repo.</p>
